                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dfd6eab4-22a2-3276-a137-b578434b5740",
                        "entry_id": "ecef20eb-bd9d-30bb-ae0b-a7b31b3f63de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "психиатр. нарушение самосознания личности, сопровождающееся отчуждением её психических свойств"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f09266a-8c30-4cfe-912b-bb6c0069d0be",
                                "sense_id": "dfd6eab4-22a2-3276-a137-b578434b5740",
                                "text": "При шизофрении препубертатного возраста нередко отчётливо устанавливаются явления деперсонализации и дереализации."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "59525cf3-b0a3-4aa2-89b0-25c4b9414f66",
                                "sense_id": "dfd6eab4-22a2-3276-a137-b578434b5740",
                                "text": "Конечно же, в психопатологии существует множество описаний деперсонализации и расщепления. Однако ни одна психопатологическая теория не способна полностью преодолеть искажение личности, наложенное её собственными посылками, хотя она и может стремиться к отрицанию этих самых посылок."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bc729fc-1881-473f-b9b9-c6b2d506239f",
                                "sense_id": "dfd6eab4-22a2-3276-a137-b578434b5740",
                                "text": "Синдром деперсонализации проявляется нарушением самосознания, искажённым восприятием собственной личности в целом с ощущением утраты её единства или искажения и отчуждения отдельных её физиологических или психических проявлений."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d3e4f8ba-5302-47ed-864e-eaf247d4283d",
                        "source_entry_id": "ecef20eb-bd9d-30bb-ae0b-a7b31b3f63de",
                        "source_sense_id": "dfd6eab4-22a2-3276-a137-b578434b5740",
                        "target_lang_word": "depersonalization",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "depersonalization",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b5eb102-8e44-318e-a542-76b45337879f",
                                        "entry_id": "2b43ab58-2588-3646-b95d-38a76382ab3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of depersonalizing or the state of being depersonalized."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29926189-a662-43e6-ae75-1cfbd116947a",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5eb102-8e44-318e-a542-76b45337879f",
                                                "text": "He was in a critical state of depersonalization."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26cd06e3-d722-3ccc-b9bc-548770e4fc0e",
                                        "entry_id": "2b43ab58-2588-3646-b95d-38a76382ab3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The loss of one's sense of personal identity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c9d33ac-cc2c-482e-8895-9a4f83caa92d",
                                                "sense_id": "26cd06e3-d722-3ccc-b9bc-548770e4fc0e",
                                                "text": "Musil is committed to the dissolution of the ego and to the defictionalization and depersonalization of character as Woolf expresses it in “The Narrow Bridge of Art.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24826b76-b584-4774-8b32-bfa4cfc403ea",
                                                "sense_id": "26cd06e3-d722-3ccc-b9bc-548770e4fc0e",
                                                "text": "His depersonalization causes a great deal of stress as he searches for an authentic personal identity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f2c6dd5-6bbb-4042-a208-4f0cddb25798",
                                                "sense_id": "26cd06e3-d722-3ccc-b9bc-548770e4fc0e",
                                                "text": "Many people experience some form of temporary depersonalisation in their lives, typically at moments of extreme fatigue or high stress, such as during a car crash, where both the established defence options of fight or flight are removed. A number of recreational drugs also precipitate similar episodes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4b8028f-c96b-34e2-adba-df532290f6a1",
                                        "entry_id": "2b43ab58-2588-3646-b95d-38a76382ab3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of being unreal, detached or unable to feel emotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c0ed83b-91d2-4559-8629-7b5d74b59768",
                                                "sense_id": "b4b8028f-c96b-34e2-adba-df532290f6a1",
                                                "text": "His severe depersonalization causes an aloof demeanor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5154bd53-d4d6-4bff-b34a-6cb2e2cdb995",
                        "source_entry_id": "ecef20eb-bd9d-30bb-ae0b-a7b31b3f63de",
                        "source_sense_id": "dfd6eab4-22a2-3276-a137-b578434b5740",
                        "target_lang_word": "depersonalisation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "depersonalisation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38b20e40-739f-3ecd-a78c-92eeb44fa69a",
                                        "entry_id": "1513ecd6-b125-34e6-af62-c708541710d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of depersonalization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8908d871-b92f-4ec5-8cd9-8b4b4d20aeaf",
                                                "sense_id": "38b20e40-739f-3ecd-a78c-92eeb44fa69a",
                                                "text": "I’ve read that depersonalisation is one of the body’s stress responses. You can’t deal with a situation, so it almost ejects you, makes you feel disconnected."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
